WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.501
Read the summary: what is ready, what
needs converting, and what can't be used.

2
00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:09.067
When it looks right, choose Start syncing.

3
00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:14.159
Scry Sync starts sending, and its Settings
window opens.

4
00:00:14.729 --> 00:00:18.588
Click its menu bar icon to follow along.

5
00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:22.623
When it says up to date, the sync is done;

6
00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:26.996
files that need attention are listed with
what to do.
